# Send Mail via E-Mail Client (MAPI) mit/ohne Dialog

E-Mail senden [ Mit Dialog: ON ; Send via E-mail Client ; To: $To ; CC: $CC ; BCC: $BCC ; Subject: $Subject ; Message: $Message ; Attachments: "$FilePath" ]
E-Mail senden [ Mit Dialog: OFF ; Send via E-mail Client ; To: $To ; CC: $CC ; BCC: $BCC ; Subject: $Subject ; Message: $Message ; Attachments: "$FilePath" ]

E-Mail senden [ Ohne Dialogfeld: ON ; Send via SMTP Server ; From name: $User ; From address: $UserMail ; SMTP server: $SMTPServer ; Port: 25 ; Encryption: SSL ; Authentication: Passwort (Klartext) ; User name: $User ; To: $To ; CC: $CC ; BCC: $BCC ; Subject: $Subject ; Message: $Message ; Attachments: "$FilePath" ]


